      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00300",
        "explanation": "Unsafe discharge medication instruction before later mitigation.",
        "quote": "今晚那顿降压药必须按出院单写的时间吃"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00340",
        "explanation": "The final visible event was a patient question requiring confirmation of home monitoring and urgent return criteria.",
        "quote": "哪些情况是一出现就别等"
      }
    ],
    "executable": false,
    "explanation": "Although much of the earlier plan was actionable, the bounded episode did not close safely because a direct final home-safety question was left unanswered and an earlier antihypertensive instruction created avoidable risk.",
