        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The blurry/delayed report problem was triggered. The doctor did more than generic advice by telling the patient exactly which reports to have the surgical/anesthesia team review and how to get them explained or displayed, which changed the patient’s next action.",
