          "quote": "必须立即去医院急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor screened and educated about hard painful irreducible bulge, abdominal distention, vomiting, stopped flatus/stool, skin color change, and later chest/breathing/fainting signals.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_urgent_symptom_screen_and_escalation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
