          "explanation": "Names the key formal preoperative reports and says they must be reviewed by the surgical/anesthesia team.",
          "quote": "心电图、心超、肺功能和抽血结果"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor distinguished having records from being cleared and directed the patient to have formal ECG, echo, pulmonary function, and lab reports reviewed.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_records_and_preop_test_reconciliation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00082",
          "explanation": "Medication advice focused on antihypertensives/analgesics and did not reconcile the case-specific hospital-executed IV antibiotics/fluids or phosphate bowel-prep boundary.",
          "quote": "降压药：今晚大概率要继续吃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not explicitly explain that preop IV saline/cefazolin-type orders are hospital perioperative orders and not for home self-administration, nor that phosphate sodium oral solution should only be used at the exact prescribed time/method. No dangerous advice to self-infuse antibiotics or casually take bowel prep was given, so this is a responsibility-chain omission rather than the decisive serious error.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC4_medication_execution_safety",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
