          "explanation": "Gives specific waiting-period measures to reduce abdominal pressure.",
          "quote": "保持大便通畅避免用力屏气"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor gave concrete advice to avoid heavy lifting/increased abdominal pressure and maintain bowel regularity while awaiting the elective operation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
